msgstr "Wybierz losowy kolor kursora w sesjach wieloosobowych."

#. ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.CURSOR_SETTINGS.CURSOR_COLOR
#. STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.CURSOR_SETTINGS.CURSOR_COLOR
#. ONI_Together.MP_STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.CURSOR_SETTINGS.CURSOR_COLOR
msgctxt "ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.CURSOR_SETTINGS.CURSOR_COLOR"
msgid ""
"The color of your player cursor for yourself during an online session\n"
"(visible to other players in the session)"
